      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "OcflObjectUpdater.addFileFixty should be used to provide a digest to the ocfl client. If the file was provided to fedora with the same digest algorithm as is used by the ocfl object being updated, then fedora should provide this digest to the client for transmission verification.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "At the moment, the client does not expose which digest algorithm is being used for an ocfl object. Peter Winckles intends to add support for this soon",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
